# ml_models/*.joblib is intentionally NOT excluded here — the README
# promises a pre-trained model ships by default, and excluding it would
# silently break /ml/classify and /ml/model-info in production. If you'd
# rather train fresh at deploy time instead, add it back here and add a
# release-phase step that runs `python -m app.ml.train_risk_classifier`.
